  description: Lucy is a small child. She lives in a fairy tale world. Her magic
    is so strong that she breathes life into whatever she believes in. As dreamy
    as it sounds, is it not so beautiful when you picture that your parents never
    existed, that the monster under your bed becomes your best and only friend?
